{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/251122f51973addc8a0f9d35b03df139.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/4a8573973b7c3e4458132ddd65c2d8ca.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3c7c0f0fda1983c11e066d17142a26bd.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3c7c0f0fda1983c11e066d17142a26bd.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3c7c0f0fda1983c11e066d17142a26bd.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures have built their unique personalities from memory and emotion in Layerland. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They create their own ecosystem with their own rules and thoughts, just like human society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e4bb18bce5b4b880158d6375645831d8.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/c9d785d7bcb2c920883ec6d298f7831c.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/c9d785d7bcb2c920883ec6d298f7831c.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/c9d785d7bcb2c920883ec6d298f7831c.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love the \u2018enemy to friend\u2019 dynamic. Even if the player battles the creatures to the death, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we can still be their friend if you catch the creature. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the casual talk to unique emotional responses, pets can be domesticated to be part of your life, to be your friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/19291efe73be38f7a4eecb5d7ebbae54.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/83b34be5b8a286928ee2f822d36bdaca.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/83b34be5b8a286928ee2f822d36bdaca.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/83b34be5b8a286928ee2f822d36bdaca.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/c27650f499be53c8e85754df456baedf.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/c27650f499be53c8e85754df456baedf.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/c27650f499be53c8e85754df456baedf.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets will respond differently depending on emotional buildup and their unique personalities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of personality will your pet have? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might expect one, but no one can truly guess until you catch them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3bd35457a242b142b83fd287ff7e7169.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3a04885d370af73e6975bd874cf7c2b1.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3a04885d370af73e6975bd874cf7c2b1.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3a04885d370af73e6975bd874cf7c2b1.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Layer land, pets support players by using their unique talents to overcome challenges </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and make the world less frightening. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They help with tasks like foraging, cooking, and building, and contribute creatively </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by sculpting, drawing, and filming. Every task can be automated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their artistic creations become lasting parts of the ecosystem you build together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/f686ec99a14a5e7f536886f40de23f03.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/d81098194524bae3c682b2db6d3a4e24.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/d81098194524bae3c682b2db6d3a4e24.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/d81098194524bae3c682b2db6d3a4e24.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own house, place furniture, and decorate a cozy home for you and your pets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Housing is a strategy, a core memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/637c5be32c9a3508ebc1223ed397aa2a.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/2eb43f9536009e78f5ba72228c4e29df.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/2eb43f9536009e78f5ba72228c4e29df.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/2eb43f9536009e78f5ba72228c4e29df.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 kinds of pets are here, but that\u2019s just the beginning. Players can create entirely new pets </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >through the breeding system. Your name will be featured in the new pet\u2019s illustrated guide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/d0dcb5e3a815c541232c429ecba7effd.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/9a212204a938bc7e2d022e74cfe8b3a7.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/9a212204a938bc7e2d022e74cfe8b3a7.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/9a212204a938bc7e2d022e74cfe8b3a7.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layerland exists in real time, even after you close the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pets might need your help while you're offline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay connected with your pet and keep an eye on your world through the Layertalk app.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/87c644e1ff2f4e91c755019980802968.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/321dafbf488db00b43bb0a963de31046.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/321dafbf488db00b43bb0a963de31046.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/321dafbf488db00b43bb0a963de31046.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layerland reflects the exact terrain of Earth through Cesium technology! Mountains, oceans, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and grassfields from the real world you\u2019ve only imagined exploring will become your playground in Layerland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/7470ebd8132c87818b866f6987786c9c.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3aebaa0f1ed92bc20d5b099dc6d576bd.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3aebaa0f1ed92bc20d5b099dc6d576bd.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3aebaa0f1ed92bc20d5b099dc6d576bd.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invasion Gates can appear anywhere, anytime\u2014without warning! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether the monsters pouring through are a deadly threat or a rare opportunity </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for valuable loot depends entirely on you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base with fortifications built alongside your loyal pet, and claim precious rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > for your bravery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e367bb11e04e45339ce7a33914de1382.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/b4e4da4d5af7fa5c1babf7c8e088f257.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/b4e4da4d5af7fa5c1babf7c8e088f257.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/b4e4da4d5af7fa5c1babf7c8e088f257.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a true-to-scale Earth built from real satellite data! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dimensional rifts open gates that transport players to alternate worlds\u2014each with a completely different ecosystem, yet mapped to the same coordinates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884970?t=1768897016","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/e61c539eeacf1d27e1c4e7f0ef7e52cc386db147/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768897016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/52f3174b760520d01ba5d42ad4773cc4f289193e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768897016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/52f3174b760520d01ba5d42ad4773cc4f289193e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768897016","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/251122f51973addc8a0f9d35b03df139.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/4a8573973b7c3e4458132ddd65c2d8ca.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3c7c0f0fda1983c11e066d17142a26bd.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3c7c0f0fda1983c11e066d17142a26bd.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3c7c0f0fda1983c11e066d17142a26bd.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures have built their unique personalities from memory and emotion in Layerland. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They create their own ecosystem with their own rules and thoughts, just like human society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e4bb18bce5b4b880158d6375645831d8.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/c9d785d7bcb2c920883ec6d298f7831c.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/c9d785d7bcb2c920883ec6d298f7831c.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/c9d785d7bcb2c920883ec6d298f7831c.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love the \u2018enemy to friend\u2019 dynamic. Even if the player battles the creatures to the death, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we can still be their friend if you catch the creature. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the casual talk to unique emotional responses, pets can be domesticated to be part of your life, to be your friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/19291efe73be38f7a4eecb5d7ebbae54.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/83b34be5b8a286928ee2f822d36bdaca.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/83b34be5b8a286928ee2f822d36bdaca.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/83b34be5b8a286928ee2f822d36bdaca.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/c27650f499be53c8e85754df456baedf.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/c27650f499be53c8e85754df456baedf.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/c27650f499be53c8e85754df456baedf.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets will respond differently depending on emotional buildup and their unique personalities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of personality will your pet have? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might expect one, but no one can truly guess until you catch them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3bd35457a242b142b83fd287ff7e7169.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3a04885d370af73e6975bd874cf7c2b1.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3a04885d370af73e6975bd874cf7c2b1.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3a04885d370af73e6975bd874cf7c2b1.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Layer land, pets support players by using their unique talents to overcome challenges </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and make the world less frightening. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They help with tasks like foraging, cooking, and building, and contribute creatively </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by sculpting, drawing, and filming. Every task can be automated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their artistic creations become lasting parts of the ecosystem you build together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/f686ec99a14a5e7f536886f40de23f03.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/d81098194524bae3c682b2db6d3a4e24.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/d81098194524bae3c682b2db6d3a4e24.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/d81098194524bae3c682b2db6d3a4e24.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own house, place furniture, and decorate a cozy home for you and your pets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Housing is a strategy, a core memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/637c5be32c9a3508ebc1223ed397aa2a.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/2eb43f9536009e78f5ba72228c4e29df.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/2eb43f9536009e78f5ba72228c4e29df.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/2eb43f9536009e78f5ba72228c4e29df.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 kinds of pets are here, but that\u2019s just the beginning. Players can create entirely new pets </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >through the breeding system. Your name will be featured in the new pet\u2019s illustrated guide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/d0dcb5e3a815c541232c429ecba7effd.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/9a212204a938bc7e2d022e74cfe8b3a7.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/9a212204a938bc7e2d022e74cfe8b3a7.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/9a212204a938bc7e2d022e74cfe8b3a7.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layerland exists in real time, even after you close the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pets might need your help while you're offline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay connected with your pet and keep an eye on your world through the Layertalk app.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/87c644e1ff2f4e91c755019980802968.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/321dafbf488db00b43bb0a963de31046.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/321dafbf488db00b43bb0a963de31046.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/321dafbf488db00b43bb0a963de31046.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layerland reflects the exact terrain of Earth through Cesium technology! Mountains, oceans, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and grassfields from the real world you\u2019ve only imagined exploring will become your playground in Layerland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/7470ebd8132c87818b866f6987786c9c.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3aebaa0f1ed92bc20d5b099dc6d576bd.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3aebaa0f1ed92bc20d5b099dc6d576bd.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3aebaa0f1ed92bc20d5b099dc6d576bd.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invasion Gates can appear anywhere, anytime\u2014without warning! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether the monsters pouring through are a deadly threat or a rare opportunity </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for valuable loot depends entirely on you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base with fortifications built alongside your loyal pet, and claim precious rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > for your bravery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e367bb11e04e45339ce7a33914de1382.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/b4e4da4d5af7fa5c1babf7c8e088f257.poster.avif?t=1768897016\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/b4e4da4d5af7fa5c1babf7c8e088f257.webm?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/b4e4da4d5af7fa5c1babf7c8e088f257.mp4?t=1768897016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a true-to-scale Earth built from real satellite data! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dimensional rifts open gates that transport players to alternate worlds\u2014each with a completely different ecosystem, yet mapped to the same coordinates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["PUDDING Co. Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/515909c7ef86673da37337536d9846a5f43c8e91/header.jpg?t=1768897016","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884970/1712621243/b0b0cb38a484941e802c46b6728476d2cb8f03e8/1757653361/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757656290","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884970/1712621243/b0b0cb38a484941e802c46b6728476d2cb8f03e8/1757653361/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757656290","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884970/1712621243/b0b0cb38a484941e802c46b6728476d2cb8f03e8/1757653361/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757656290","id":257194843,"name":"trailorEngVers","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194843/b2374da52cce3b00c0fc75628cdd2d21c9206a17/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757656290"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884970/83885247/f579d930c89d68c290877083698758e342fc637d/1767759776/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767760739","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884970/83885247/f579d930c89d68c290877083698758e342fc637d/1767759776/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767760739","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884970/83885247/f579d930c89d68c290877083698758e342fc637d/1767759776/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767760739","id":257260926,"name":"petRiding","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257260926/2941451f600a6858d22ecc132017096a65a74300/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767760739"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884970/1708560064/0d6f2a3c24be4ebdea0bb5bc614e12278a8b9c16/1768815051/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768816170","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.st